    {
      "name": "get_live_heloc_rates",
      "description": "Price HELOC (variable) and fixed home equity loan options from the current rate sheet of C2 Financial Corporation (NMLS #135622), in the states where it is licensed; other states return not available. These are second liens, so the existing first mortgage stays in place. Use when a homeowner asks about HELOC or home equity loan rates or payments for their home. Available up to 90% combined loan-to-value. Pricing uses the homeowner's stated credit score range, home value, lien balances, requested amount, occupancy and units; no credit check is made. Returns rate, APR, monthly payments and the rate-sheet date, or the reason no quote is available. Quotes are subject to credit approval and are not a commitment to lend.",
